{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116065","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116065/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116065/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116065/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116065","id":3913516673,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7pQ4aB","number":116065,"title":"Mipmaps create different alpha borders depending on image creation software (PSD, Clip Studio, Krita)","user":{"login":"fakemaxwell","id":59422275,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDIyMjc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59422275?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fakemaxwell","html_url":"https://github.com/fakemaxwell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fakemaxwell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fakemaxwell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fakemaxwell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fakemaxwell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fakemaxwell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fakemaxwell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fakemaxwell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fakemaxwell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fakemaxwell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-02-08T20:40:11Z","updated_at":"2026-02-23T05:44:26Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot v4.5.stable, Godot v4.6.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 4 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-14700K (28 threads) - 31.74 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\n<img width=\"614\" height=\"592\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fbb09499-e72d-435b-89dd-5370ae6136f5\" />\n\nDifferent image creation software creates different alpha borders when using mipmaps and zooming.  The images from Photoshop and CSP have white borders, the images from Krita and Affinity appear to have black (it's harder to see even when changing the background color, but that's best guess). Changing any and all of the import settings, project texture settings have not alleviated the problem.  Only disabling mipmaps helps, unfortunately that's not really tenable.\n\nProject contains the above images for testing.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a PNG image in multiple software, import with default settings and mipmaps, zoom out and see what the border is.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mipmap-transparency.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25169735/mipmap-transparency.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116065/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116065/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}